Genuine Madrid beat rivals Barcelona 2-1 at home in an engaging, Real madrid vs Barcelona live precipitation drenched Clasico on Saturday to go top of La Liga.

Karim Benzema put the heroes in control at a soaked Alfredo Di Stefano arena with a magnificent backheel in the fourteenth moment while an avoided Toni Kroos free kick multiplied their lead in the 28th.

