Barcelona mentor Ronald Koeman was left smoldering a short time later by the decison to compensate his side a punishment.

&#8220;As a matter of first importance I need to say in the primary half we weren&#8217;t acceptable, assaulting or protecting,&#8221; Koeman said. &#8220;Second half we improved and I just ask that the refs get choices right.

